### Ford Brasil Vehicle Catalog API — HTTP Requests
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### ============================================
### Health
### ============================================

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health

### ============================================
### Vehicles
### ============================================

### List all vehicles (default pagination)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/vehicles

### List vehicles — page 2
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/vehicles?page=2&limit=10

### Filter by category
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/vehicles?categoria=Picape

### Filter by model
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/vehicles?modelo=Ranger

### Filter by version
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/vehicles?versao=Raptor

### Filter by color
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/vehicles?cor=Branco

### Filter by vehicle type
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/vehicles?tipo_veiculo=SUV

### Filter by fuel type
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/vehicles?combustivel=Diesel

### Filter by traction
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/vehicles?tracao=4WD

### Filter by transmission
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/vehicles?transmissao=Automática

### Filter by price range
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/vehicles?preco_min=100000&preco_max=300000

### Sort by price ascending
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/vehicles?sort=preco_asc

### Sort by price descending
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/vehicles?sort=preco_desc

### Combined filters
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/vehicles?categoria=Picape&combustivel=Diesel&sort=preco_asc&page=1&limit=5

### Get vehicle by ID (replace with actual UUID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/vehicles/some-uuid-here

### Get vehicle by slug
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/vehicles/ranger-raptor-4wd-at

### ============================================
### Categories
### ============================================

### List all categories
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/categories

### ============================================
### Colors
### ============================================

### List all colors
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/colors

### ============================================
### Models
### ============================================

### List all models
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/models

### ============================================
### Versions
### ============================================

### List all versions
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/versions

### ============================================
### Search
### ============================================

### Search vehicles
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/search?q=ranger

### Search with pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/search?q=territory&page=1&limit=5

### ============================================
### Sync
### ============================================

### Trigger full sync (scrape + persist)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/sync
Content-Type: application/json

### Get sync history
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/sync/history

### Get last 5 sync runs
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/sync/history?limit=5

### ============================================
### Sources
### ============================================

### List all official sources
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/sources

### ============================================
### Stats
### ============================================

### Get catalog statistics
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/stats

### ============================================
### Legacy Scrapper Endpoints (under /api/v1 prefix)
### ============================================

### Scrape Ford (GET — returns data only, doesn't persist)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/scrapper/ford

### Scrape Ford (POST — scrapes and persists)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/scrapper/ford
Content-Type: application/json
